{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39308","headline":"夏口行寄婺州诸弟 · 韦庄","name":"夏口行寄婺州诸弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"回头烟树各天涯，婺女星边远寄家。\n尽眼楚波连梦泽，满衣春雪落江花。\n双双得伴争如雁，一一归巢却羡鵶。\n谁道我随张博望，悠悠空外泛僊槎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39308.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39308","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}